{
    "title": "Regal: Tickets and Showtimes",
    "description": "Find showtimes for new releases and skip the box office lines with Regal. Visiting your cinema is easier than ever with digital movie tickets for the latest films in the palm of your hand. View film ratings, watch the newest movies, and hit up concessions all with the help of the Regal mobile app.\r\n\r\nCinema night is better than ever when you use Regal. Discover new releases, find movie times, buy movie tickets ahead of time, and visit your nearest Regal theater for a seamless moviegoing experience. With the Regal mobile app, you can even earn rewards for watching the newest movies when you purchase tickets directly in app!\r\n\r\nCollect credits with every movie ticket purchase once you join the Regal Crown Club for free! Enjoy movie deals and discounts on concessions as a member, get 10% off all food and non-alcoholic beverages when you visit Regal Cinemas, and enjoy a cinema experience like no other. The Regal mobile app was made to enhance your moviegoing adventures.\r\n\r\nWant even more movie theater perks? Upgrade to a Regal Unlimited movie subscription pass and get all the benefits of Regal Crown Club and more! Watch as many movies as you want, as many times as you want, whenever you want, wherever you want. From movie coupons, exclusive rewards, and deals on concessions, Regal Unlimited is your portal to a whole new way to visit the theater.\r\n\r\nThe best movie theater experience starts here. Discover a better way to buy movie tickets, visit theaters, and earn rewards. Download Regal today and take your movie night to new heights.\r\n\r\nGET SHOWTIMES AND BUY MOVIE TICKETS INSTANTLY\r\n\u2022 From new releases to current movies \u2013 discover them on Regal\r\n\u2022 Get last minute movie tickets at a theater near you\r\n\u2022 Buy tickets for films coming soon to visit as soon as they release\r\n\u2022 Skip the line with your mobile movie ticket\r\n\r\nFIND MOVIE THEATERS NEAR YOU\r\n\u2022 Watch new releases at your favorite movie theaters\r\n\u2022 Search for cinemas in other locations easily\r\n\u2022 Find movie times at a specific theater to plan your movie night\r\n\u2022 Cinema directions available in app to make your next visit seamless\r\n\r\nCONCESSIONS AVAILABLE DIRECTLY IN THE APP\r\n\u2022 Browse and order concessions at select theaters in just a few taps\r\n\u2022 Get concession discounts with Unlimited and Regal Crown Club memberships\r\n\u2022 Redeem your Crown Club points in exchange for snacks and concessions\r\n\u2022 Receive alerts when concession orders are ready for pickup\r\n\r\nSIGN UP FOR REGAL CROWN CLUB & REGAL UNLIMITED\r\n\u2022 Visit movie theaters, watch movies, and earn rewards\r\n\u2022 Collect movie coupons and rewards for every dollar spent on movie tickets and concessions\r\n\u2022 Use your Regal physical card or store it in-app for quick access when visiting cinemas\r\n\u2022 Check your Regal Crown Club balance right in the Regal mobile app\r\n\r\nPrepare for your next movie night with the ultimate film companion. Find showtimes, buy movie tickets, earn exclusive rewards, and watch the latest films \u2013 all with Regal.\r\n\r\nBy downloading, installing and using this App, you agree to Regal Cinemas Mobile Application Privacy Policy and Terms of Use\r\n\r\nRegal Cinemas Mobile Application Privacy Policy: https://www.regmovies.com/static/en/us/privacy\r\nRegal Cinemas Terms of Use: https://www.regmovies.com/static/en/us/MobileApplication/termsofuse",
